 헉...","female":"너... 헉, 헉...","variant_male_record_index":"194331","variant_female_record_index":"194332","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1524604001":{"text":"너... 헉, 헉...","source_cn":"你……呼……呼……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1E01B801026B874D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너... 헉, 헉...","female":"너... 헉, 헉...","variant_male_record_index":"194331","variant_female_record_index":"194332","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1524604002:0":{"text":"윽, 아니... 됐어.","source_cn":"呃……不，不用了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8401860556BD9DF0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"윽, 아니... 됐어.","female":"윽, 아니... 됐어.","variant_male_record_index":"194333","variant_female_record_index":"194334","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1524604003:1":{"text":"라이언로어 잘못이라고! 갈라가 희귀한 약초를 찾아달라고 부탁해서 반나절을 뒤져서 겨우 찾았는데, 이 덜렁이가 그걸 잃어버렸잖아!","source_cn":"都是狮吼的错！加拉委托我们找一种珍稀的药草，我们整整找...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5E130BD4459CC506","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"라이언로어 잘못이라고! 갈라가 희귀한 약초를 찾아달라고 부탁해서 반나절을 뒤져서 겨우 찾았는데, 이 덜렁이가 그걸 잃어버렸잖아!","female":"라이언로어 잘못이라고! 갈라가 희귀한 약초를 찾아달라고 부탁해서 반나절을 뒤져서 겨우 찾았는데, 이 덜렁이가 그걸 잃어버렸잖아!","variant_male_record_index":"194335","variant_female_record_index":"194336","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1524604004:1":{"text":"헛소리 하고 있네! 네가 잃어버렸잖아? 약초를 가방에 넣은 건 너고, 난 그 가방을 그냥 들고 있었을 뿐이야. 약초에는 손도 안 댔어!","source_cn":"胡说，分明是你弄丢的！当时药草是你摘下来放包裹里的，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2283F46E9027FD86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1524604005:1":{"text":"그럼 영지에 왔을 때 약초가 왜 없어졌는데? 분명 네가 챙기다 떨어뜨렸겠지!","source_cn":"那药草回到营地怎么就没了？肯定是你拿东西时候，把它弄丢了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73318EB995A946A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1524604006:1":{"text":"억지도 적당히 부려야지. 너...!","source_cn":"强词夺理！你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x630E6293985A6EC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1524604006":{"text":"억지도 적당히 부려야지. 너...!","source_cn":"强词夺理！你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x630E6293985A6EC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1524604007:1":{"text":"흥, 그렇게 말한다면... 좋아, 다시 살펴보지.","source_cn":"哼，既然你这么说……好吧，我再翻一遍。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA3643CA14846A0BD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"흥, 그렇게 말한다면... 좋아, 다시 살펴보지.","female":"흥, 그렇게 말한다면... 좋아, 다시 살펴보지.","variant_male_record_index":"194340","variant_female_record_index":"194341","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1524604008:1":{"text":"나도 같이 찾겠어. 나한테 다 뒤집어씌울 생각 하지 마!","source_cn":"我也一起找，你别想把责任推到我身上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54929FEBA1C4C36B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","va